
The Core Problem
You have code that passes static analysis—no syntax errors, imports exist, variables are defined—but it produces wrong results. Classic examples:
Off-by-one errors in loops
Wrong operators (+ instead of *)
Incorrect conditionals (< instead of <=)
Logic that works for some inputs but not edge cases
Static analysis can't catch these. You need execution + oracles.

