Failure Modes & Handling

| Scenario                          | Detection            | Handling                                       |
| --------------------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Infinite loop                     | Timeout (5s)         | Mark `can_repair: false`, suggest human review |
| Memory exhaustion                 | Subprocess OOM       | Catch stderr, mark resource\_error             |
| Syntax error in generated harness | JSON parse fail      | Return parse\_error status                     |
| Non-deterministic code (random)   | Flaky results        | Run 3×, majority vote                          |
| Side effects (file/network)       | Subprocess isolation | Limited impact, may timeout                    |
